sequenceDiagram
  participant T1 as Txn 1
  participant DB as Database
  participant T2 as Txn 2
  T1->>DB: BEGIN
  T1->>DB: SELECT balance WHERE id=1
  DB-->>T1: 100
  T2->>DB: BEGIN
  T2->>DB: UPDATE balance = 50 WHERE id=1
  Note over T2,DB: Dirty read if T1 sees 50 before T2 commits
  T2->>DB: COMMIT
  T1->>DB: SELECT balance WHERE id=1
  DB-->>T1: 50 (READ COMMITTED) or 100 (REPEATABLE READ)
  Note over T1,DB: 50 here = non-repeatable read
  T1->>DB: COMMIT
